title HUNK51 — the finger-driven Photos editor: a finger edits the picture, the glass repaints, from one cursor
prompt Continue the autonomous loop — next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, self-approve design rounds, send each finished increment as its own signed round, stop only at custody gates.
think HUNK50 read a finger into an edit_input.Gesture but moved no cursor; HUNK49 owned a cursor and painted it but took a gesture already made; HUNK48 applied a gesture to a cursor. Three proven pieces standing slightly apart. A real device wants one object it hands raw finger coordinates to and watches the picture change — the touch surface and the glass sharing one history.
think The scroll arc already closed exactly this at HUNK47 (TouchView bound the finger session and the painted view to one cursor so the page never drifts). Lindy-first crux-first picked the symmetric edit capstone: the finger-driven view, composing only proven parts, living in brushstroke/ beside edit_touch_view (the assembly where the cursor+preview binding already resolves).
think Shape: brushstroke/edit_finger_view.rye EditFingerView { input: EditTouch (HUNK50), view: EditTouchView (HUNK49) } — open opens both sub-surfaces so a bad grid refuses BadView and a bad cell/swipe refuses BadCell/BadSwipe, each once; bind lays a strip verb (StripFull); finger_down arms; finger_up classifies through HUNK50 and, when a gesture fires, applies it through HUNK49 to the ONE owned cursor; paint delegates to HUNK49. The crux: the finger and the picture share one cursor, so the glass cannot drift from what the finger did, structurally — the same one-graph discipline HUNK47 used for scroll.
obs Built GREEN first metal run, no red — the REDS #76 loom held (native assert out contains), so the GREEN line's apostrophes never threatened the witness. Symlinked image/edit_touch_input.rye into brushstroke/ so HUNK50 resolves in the assembly (mirroring edit_input/edit_cursor/photo_edits/qoi already symlinked there). No compound asserts; one positive invariant per line.
obs Witness reads behavior on glass over an 8x8 two-tone, 2x2 grid, one-verb (flip_h) strip, ten-pixel cell: a fresh surface paints the source (left cell red), a tap on the strip cell repaints the flip (left cell blue), a left swipe repaints the source and a right swipe the flip; a tap off the strip fires nothing (picture unchanged); paint equals a direct view.paint cell-for-cell (no drift); the view rasterizes to a lit canvas with blue in the left cell; a zero grid, a zero cell, and a zero swipe each refuse at open. HUNK50 classifier, HUNK49 view, HUNK48 seam GREEN beneath; tame bans clean, width exit 0.
loom witness=hunk_edit_finger_view_witness image=8x8_two_tone grid=2x2 strip=flip_h cell_px=10 swipe_px=12 events=tap_commit,left_undo,right_redo drift_check=paint==view.paint refusals=BadView,BadCell,BadSwipe
file brushstroke/edit_finger_view.rye HUNK51 — EditFingerView binds HUNK50's finger classifier and HUNK49's painted view to one cursor; a finger edits, the glass repaints, and the picture cannot drift from the finger.
file brushstroke/edit_touch_input.rye symlink to image/edit_touch_input.rye so HUNK50 resolves in the brushstroke assembly.
file tools/hunk_edit_finger_view_witness.rish proves the surface on metal — a tap repaints the edit on glass, swipes repaint the walked history, a tap off the strip does nothing, no drift, bad geometry refuses.
file active-designing/20260813-205200_hunk-edit-finger-view-exploration.md self-approved design read.
file work-in-progress/REMEMBER.md git nib refreshed in this same work commit.
recommend keep-going — the Photos editing story now stands whole end to end (input seam HUNK48 · touchable view HUNK49 · finger classifier HUNK50 · finger-driven view HUNK51), the exact mirror of the browse story (HUNK40–47). HUNK52 could paint the gesture strip as a Skate row of verb chips beside the picture (reusing HUNK2's down-map), record a raw finger session content-addressed (composing HUNK12's edit store), or open a fresh Season-A / double-seat journey. The served-market module-assembly ruling and hardware buys stay Keaton's gates.
